{
  "name": "dsh-qq-shell-commands",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "目的是能远程运行 Shell 命令，而不是让 DSH 运行，适用于需要重复工作或托管行为但不能直接给权限到 DSH 的情况。原理是通过 NapCat 进程与 QQ 进行交互，当 QQ 发送特定消息，判断是否完全相等与哪个键的字符串，并执行对应的 Shell 命令。执行 Shell=\"执行 Shell 命令：\\n文本\"。添加新的键值对=\"增加 Shell 命令：\\n{\"文本\": [\"Shell 命令\", \"使用哪个 Shell (例如 cmd，或 PowerShell) 运行 Shell 命令\"]}\"，最终会被拼接为 \"Shell 命令\" 的格式被系统运行，依赖前置插件 \"EviMing/dsh-napcat-tools\"",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "lib/*.mjs",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "config.example.json",
    "locale/*.json",
    "test/selftest.mjs",
    "test/boot-check.mjs",
    "test/live-ws.mjs",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "qq",
    "napcat",
    "onebot",
    "shell",
    "remote-shell"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "EviMing",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/EviMing/dsh-qq-shell-commands.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/EviMing/dsh-qq-shell-commands#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/EviMing/dsh-qq-shell-commands/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  }
}
